        "duplicate dictionary/decoded names",
        "memo/stack/opcode/depth limit violations",
        "writer"
      ],
      "length_rule": "offset = tuple[0] XOR key; decoded_length = tuple[1] XOR key; stored_length = decoded_length - prefix_length. Only stored_length bytes are read before the index.",
      "caveat": "The reference C# reader selects values[0]; this Python version deliberately rejects len(chunks)!=1 instead of losing data. Legitimate object-constructor pickles are also refused."
